// Phase 4.7 — image-repost detection via perceptual blockhash.
//
// Catches users re-posting the same image (or a near-duplicate — a JPEG
// recompression, mild crop, small color shift). Uses upstream CM's blockhash
// approach via pure-JS pipeline (upng-js + jpeg-js + blockhash-core) — no
// native deps, runs inside Devvit's 30s/no-binding constraints.
//
// **SHIP THIS BEHIND dryRun: true** until your sub has watched the dry-run
// feed for a few days. Image-repost false-positives nuke legit crossposts,
// daily-thread imagery, meme remixes — the rule is intentionally loose. Mods
// opt into live mode after the feed shows the matches they expect.
//
// Threshold notes (Vinh's 0.10 spike, 2026-05-18):
//   - 0-2 bits: near-identical (same image, different JPEG compression)
//   - 3-5 bits: same composition, minor crop / color shift
//   - 6-8 bits: "same image" by upstream CM convention
//   - 9+ bits: usually different images
// Default 8 = within upstream's threshold. Tighten to 5 for stricter match
// (less recall but fewer FPs); loosen to 12 for aggressive dedupe.
//
// Demo storyline (judges): mod installs → submits a known image → submits
// the same image again 30 seconds later → bot fires comment "this image
// was posted recently (matched t3_xxx)".

{
  dryRun: true,
  runs: [
    {
      name: 'image-repost-watch',
      checks: [
        {
          name: 'duplicate-image-detected',
          combinator: 'AND',
          // Skip self-posts (the rule body uses item.imageUrl which is only
          // populated for link posts with a preview-redd.it variant); the
          // filter just makes the intent explicit + cheap-fails early.
          filters: { itemIs: { isSelf: false } },
          rules: [
            {
              kind: 'imageRepost',
              name: 'image-blockhash-match',
              hammingThreshold: 8, // upstream CM "same image" default
              windowDays: 30,
            },
          ],
          actions: [
            {
              kind: 'comment',
              template:
                "Hey {{author.nameSafe}} 👋 — this image looks like a repost from the last 30 days. " +
                'Mods reviewing this and removing if duplicate. Original poster context preserved in mod log.',
              dryRun: true, // belt-and-suspenders per-action gate
            },
            {
              kind: 'report',
              reason: 'Possible image repost (perceptual hash match)',
            },
          ],
          postBehavior: 'stop',
        },
      ],
    },
  ],
}
